  "ingredients": [
    "4 teaspoon fresh garlic (pressed)",
    "2 ounce butter",
    "12 ounce cauliflower",
    "1/3 cup heavy whipping cream",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "24 ounce boneless, skinless chicken thighs",
    "10 ounce bacon",
    "2 tablespoon olive oil",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "12 ounce spinach"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all the ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-bacon-wrapped-chicken-with-cauliflower-puree/#wprm-recipe-53705-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Bacon-Wrapped-Chicken-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Peel off the skin of the garlic cloves and press the fresh garlic with the handle of a knife.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-bacon-wrapped-chicken-with-cauliflower-puree/#wprm-recipe-53705-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Bacon-Wrapped-Chicken-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fry the pressed fresh garlic in butter for 1-2 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-bacon-wrapped-chicken-with-cauliflower-puree/#wprm-recipe-53705-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Bacon-Wrapped-Chicken-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rinse the cauliflower and cut into small florets. Cook the cauliflower for 2-3 minutes in a pan of lightly salted water.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-bacon-wrapped-chicken-with-cauliflower-puree/#wprm-recipe-53705-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Bacon-Wrapped-Chicken-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Put the slightly tender cauliflower in a food processor with the fried garlic and butter. Then, add the heavy whipping cream.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-bacon-wrapped-chicken-with-cauliflower-puree/#wprm-recipe-53705-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Bacon-Wrapped-Chicken-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pulse the food processor until the mixture is smooth. Add water as needed to achieve your desired consistency for the cauliflower puree.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-bacon-wrapped-chicken-with-cauliflower-puree/#wprm-recipe-53705-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Bacon-Wrapped-Chicken-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wrap each chicken breast in 1-2 pieces of bacon and fry in olive oil over medium-high heat until bacon looks thoroughly cooked. Use a food thermometer to ensure chicken is cooked thoroughly (165 F). You may put in the oven if chicken has not reached 165 F by frying. Use this same pan to fry the spinach for 1-3 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-bacon-wrapped-chicken-with-cauliflower-puree/#wprm-recipe-53705-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Bacon-Wrapped-Chicken-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Plate the cauliflower puree with the chicken breast and fried spinach. Enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-bacon-wrapped-chicken-with-cauliflower-puree/#wprm-recipe-53705-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": null
    }
